         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Packaging correction. Deploy TGScripts code and compiled script documentation in their designated directories, with screenshots stored alongside their script guides.
               <br/>
               <br/>
               Astro Bucket List 0.35.0: Import a chosen SOL list into a new or existing list, using the saved list name as the editable default. Merge matching objects with the collection while preserving current values. Fix single-list imports to exclude imaging history, comments and other metadata from unselected source lists.
            </p>
